        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "At $(0,1)$, $y'$ changes from positive to negative, so the $y$-intercept is a maximum turning point. At $(-1,2e^{-1})$, $y''$ changes from positive to negative, so the point is a point of inflection.",
